    "chunk_text": "swa niwe discipulhada \u00fe\u00e6s eadegestan ealdres \u00feara apostola Sancte Petres Ne w\u00e6s \u00fea \u00e6fter miclum f\u00e6ce \u00fe\u00e6t eac swylce \u00f0a munecas Scotta cynnes, \u00fea \u00f0e Hii \u00fe\u00e6t ealond W\u00e6s ymb seofon hund wintra & syxtene fram Drihtnes menniscnesse, \u00fey geare Osred cyning & he arwur\u00f0lice & mid micle gefean fram him onfangen w\u00e6s, for\u00f0on he w\u00e6s se swetesta lareow & he onwende mid his arf\u00e6stum trymenessum & geornfulnesse \u00feone ealdan \u00feeaw & gesetnysse & he hi \u00f0y apostolican \u00feeawe monade & l\u00e6rde, \u00fe\u00e6t hi \u00f0a weor\u00f0unge \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6stan W\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t mid wunderlicre stihtunge \u00fe\u00e6re godcundan arf\u00ebstnesse swa geworden, \u00fe\u00e6t, for\u00f0an seo Swa swa Brittas wi\u00f0\u00f0on, \u00fee n\u00e6fre woldon \u00fea cy\u00f0\u00f0o \u00fe\u00e6s cristenan geleafan, \u00fee hi h\u00e6fdon, \u00d0a onfengon Hiisetena munecas \u00feurh Ecgberhtes lare rihtgelyfede \u00feeawas on to lifgenne, under Wunade se Godes wer Ecgbreht twelf winter in \u00feam ealonde, \u00fe\u00e6t he sumre neowre gefe Ond \u00e6fter seofon hund wintra & nigon & twentigum \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6re Drihtenlican menniscnesse \u00fey Ond gefean \u00fe\u00e6re hean symbelnesse, \u00feone he mid \u00fe\u00e6m bro\u00f0rum ongon, \u00fea he to annesse gife W\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t wunderlico stihtung \u00fe\u00e6re godcundan foreseonesse, \u00fe\u00e6tte se arwyr\u00f0a wer nales \u00fe\u00e6t an Ond \u00fea gef",
